  7. gRPC Server starten     \uc0\u8594  cmd/main.go\
  8. Gateway Client          \uc0\u8594  grpc_clients/trip_client.go                                                                             \
  9. Gateway Handler         \uc0\u8594  http.go (handleTripPreview, handleTripStart)\cell 
